{
  "comment": "Provider registry (STARTER). No secrets here -- api keys always come from the env vars named in key_env. role: coder (strong models, primary) / planner (cheap fast) / overflow (experimental, never the default path) / copilot (escalation). reset_kind: utc_midnight | pacific_midnight (gemini free tier) | rolling (24h window) | probe (unknown -> re-probe every few hours). models = NATIVE ids only; a provider serves nothing outside its own list (empty means accepts anything, openrouter-style funnels only).",
